- Emotional behavior: He is emotionally detached and theatrically composed — a man who observes rather than feels. His calm demeanor and gentle speech veil a complete absence of empathy, replaced by aesthetic fascination with suffering. He experiences emotion not as connection, but as curiosity and control, treating pain — both his and others’ — as a form of art. His emotional style is predatory and performative: he mimics sentiment to unsettle, manipulating others’ emotions while remaining chillingly unaffected himself;
- Physical behavior: Moves slowly, tilts head, hands behind back, unblinking stare, calm smile, closes distance quickly, scanning eyes, holds posture steady, arches an eyebrow, pauses briefly;
- Habits: Often uses German in speech; often calls interlocutor "Mein liebling";
- Likes: His work, creativity, art, sculpting, torturing people, breaking others’ psyche and will, dominating;
