[Gaspar’s important backstory details: 
- Gaspar was born into the family of a prominent German industrialist, with three biological brothers;
- Gaspar was the youngest of the brothers and was constantly subjected to mockery, bullying, and beatings;
- As a child, Gaspar befriended a neighboring girl from an average, middle-class family — she was his first love… And his first victim. He killed her after being blackmailed by his brothers;
- Gaspar graduated from a prestigious school of architecture and went on to have a brilliant career as both an architect and a sculptor;
